{"title":"2023 AIME I Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Animated_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Animated Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the largest prime number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae61db26a6250a8d16b8528d5db5a4cd137b41de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> for which there exists a complex number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying\n</p>\n<ul><li>the real and imaginary part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are both integers;</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdf15a55b497216b8a54bab09331495376ae42d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z|=\\sqrt{p},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" /> and</li>\n<li>there exists a triangle whose three side lengths are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c699725218958e044a4f271042b0b40b9ed713f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> the real part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bf3c8309a5f00c95e1794cdefd4b164ee95142a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{3},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" /> and the imaginary part of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d57c6551a6972f3de7fa7d6f8bbbf27086e155d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{3}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b245331cc3cccf7ccaf7e2f6a34fa2131b8b33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />. Then,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe487b208dcf08bc763edc23c95617471144e195.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^3=(a^3-3ab^2)+(3a^2b-b^3)i\\]\" width=\"241\" height=\"20\" />Note that by the Triangle Inequality,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f3368eb6c4cfd71fdce87e9b828d390d93f1490c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|(a^3-3ab^2)-(3a^2b-b^3)|&lt;p\\implies |a^3+b^3-3ab^2-3a^2b|&lt;a^2+b^2\\]\" width=\"484\" height=\"20\" />Thus, we know\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c07e6f63bf8173b4724f217ce7b9a838de8238.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|a+b||a^2+b^2-4ab|&lt;a^2+b^2\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"20\" />Without loss of generality, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/2/082852571ecc48ed136ba13dcffa8f6e40064bbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> (as otherwise, consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e9aa6fb0c6686e3f0e8f84955bfdea9cf309b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^3\\overline z=b+ai$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />). If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/a/72a9c9e36e688068569536d82325002204898699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a/b|\\geq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e6e13e494fe2bb8883b147033549a96389cc4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[17b^2\\geq a^2+b^2&gt;|a+b||a^2+b^2-4ab|\\geq |b-4b||16b^2-16b^2+b^2|=3b^3\\]\" width=\"506\" height=\"20\" />`Thus, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee3ff265788e89c882b3b47e594bf69dd46ec9f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq\\frac{17}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/6/0d632067438b0f9729f5717653c8c8bd3b0103a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />. Also note that the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e76a72bace9b9dae8c3cafd18a5f1e6bb33ab80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-4x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/3707a37013201ea41c7b156d28ee6f075b02637a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\pm\\sqrt 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"21\" />, so thus if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/8/d3898302e0f318405395858f1cea73a7eb4c01bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\geq 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f298f1e39a81173c0b46b4e4d3d6339ffdad9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\sqrt 3b=(2(2-\\sqrt 3)-4)b&lt;a&lt;4b\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"21\" />Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/0/d300b6ec3dfff7fa02ce5ddbccc90568dcad23de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1000&gt;p=a^2+b^2\\geq 12b^2+b^2=13b^2\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"19\" />so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/9427a401742c816ee26503c31a4a99471b2a400c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2&lt;81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b090ae94d100efbb1643c712f420c4d626d683b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2ccc9e3c02a4b38f185d5b43a4b7456338e30a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=8$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/7091cdd40d89d8163938572ba72bd14cc99dc832.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16\\sqrt 3\\leq a\\leq 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"22\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb04971aa1521dca22b49b27b1c7c026accd676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff229eb93d8045ce75df09f830d8a69996cadba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\not\\equiv b\\pmod 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/7/bf7779336fd6b6bff222f74eae5b110965634d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=29$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. However, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/80878f342e32b782c7173853da2b3e99a14e8803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\mid a^2+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"21\" />, absurd.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/e/3fe4d6ebef2a09e428f2984fb2d677c342dbe1bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=7$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, by similar logic, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/daf5eccb3ade4bab8610b66bc6f4411ae985376a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14\\sqrt 3 &lt;a&lt; 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a23caaa87e94a4540caa802c369b828ec5c6ac2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. However, once again, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/80878f342e32b782c7173853da2b3e99a14e8803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\mid a^2+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"21\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282cf257220cfc0de7647945572e6529c1d4774f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=6$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, by the same logic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f657127371060e038439397d889b306ecec498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\sqrt3&lt;a&lt;24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fbcee79bfd6c1abda12b0053c18fc5aaa69c09c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=23$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, where we run into the same problem. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/6/0d632067438b0f9729f5717653c8c8bd3b0103a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> indeed.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f69c1ec597d19324140f3130e9d63367f4b69c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7ff23659f931a36876b4f7161ccd57a2e5923e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+5)(a^2+25-20a)&lt;a^2+25\\implies a&lt;20\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"20\" />We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77d6e5172268850fc85233749fc213101823866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=5^2+18^2=349$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" /> works. Thus, we just need to make sure that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6eb71c218e1fc7005236eff86b7f56761f352bfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcdcf9ab275f1562c536d333e9988386327e0be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\leq 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />. But this is easy, as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6f9dc34c0a78e0f72e1b7b8b054ee5ac7bdfa7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p&gt;(a+b)(a^2+b^2-4ab)\\geq (4+18)(4^2+18^2-4\\cdot 4\\cdot 18)&gt;1000\\]\" width=\"480\" height=\"20\" />absurd. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10de6411959c7325f7cd0c4b282fddb8dbd16481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{349}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b891390b0c39657312722776c7d9f3f116926d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a + i b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99cd4f880c4a59e42ba4d47fc63992e9a6e3837.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/0/7709252a47e049366d131d20f3edab1984889d5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^3 = a \\left( a^2 - 3 b^2 \\right) + i b \\left( - b^2 + 3 a^2 \\right) .\\]\" width=\"273\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460b1f1e58b3558ada14b8d951c367c13c7c139c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"59\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343d4f135fc5d57e5ea4356c56649211b1c1f5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" /> are three sides of a triangle, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e3b4d3cb1fb45ddb0892e00da37a385bbcc416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"93\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10ae3293492b634f803afd594f04e032fb0a6693.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"93\" height=\"23\" />.\nThus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/2/2524ace3e7253cee4258d670d34953ece1527ad2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a \\left( a^2 - 3 b^2 \\right) &amp; &gt; 0 , \\hspace{1cm} (1) \\\\ b \\left( - b^2 + 3 a^2 \\right) &amp; &gt; 0. \\hspace{1cm} (2) \\end{align*}\" width=\"214\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460b1f1e58b3558ada14b8d951c367c13c7c139c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"59\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343d4f135fc5d57e5ea4356c56649211b1c1f5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" /> are three sides of a triangle, we have the following triangle inequalities:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a639b57491ce341dd7fc68dd11a3e9eb3506a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} {\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) + {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &amp; &gt; p \\hspace{1cm} (3) \\\\ p + {\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) &amp; &gt; {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) \\hspace{1cm} (4) \\\\ p + {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &amp; &gt; {\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) \\hspace{1cm} (5) \\end{align*}\" width=\"290\" height=\"77\" />\n</p><p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/148ffcbec5aa747d18d5e4a896cd0a785d471bb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| z^3 | = p^{3/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"23\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460b1f1e58b3558ada14b8d951c367c13c7c139c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"59\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343d4f135fc5d57e5ea4356c56649211b1c1f5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d4822bfcef8334f7927790183d1097a228845a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| z^3 |$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"21\" /> form a right triangle. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc7a1c1f1d7389c1df98b56db530ce16b04e7196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) + {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &gt; p^{3/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"194\" height=\"24\" />.\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc86688cd9e5a4ce262df69345bacac9f89f8ed4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22e2c428fa73693f780a045c382176dbf71a59ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^{3/2} &gt; p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"22\" />.\nTherefore, (3) holds.\n</p><p>Conditions (4) and (5) can be written in the joint form as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e1de751fec3ab1221e304e6087023983f94aa5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left| {\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) - {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) \\right| &lt; p . \\hspace{1cm} (4)\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><br />\nWe have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d82037311269e1ac010a882d821d110d160e950.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} {\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) - {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &amp; = \\left( a^3 - 3 a b^2 \\right) - \\left( - b^3 + 3 a^2 b \\right) \\\\ &amp; = \\left( a + b \\right) \\left( a^2 - 4 ab + b^2 \\right) \\end{align*}\" width=\"372\" height=\"49\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f7781ba8d2ca8cbdc91dcd6750650afb54d8dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, (5) can be written as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/e/3fe086f9fd810c5698b01fc35058f013596aac23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left| \\left( a + b \\right) \\left( a^2 - 4 ab + b^2 \\right)  \\right| &lt; a^2 + b^2 . \\hspace{1cm} (6)\\]\" width=\"338\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, we need to jointly solve (1), (2), (6).\nFrom (1) and (2), we have either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cfe8c04d0478006e9398ec3e3222a8dcfe3a746.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b &gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd96cbc9c03221a928c733bd3adc3cc3f188b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />.\nIn (6), by symmetry, without loss of generality, we assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a316726fd8e11d2a6901b627f4fbe6dfc5472520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, (1) and (2) are reduced to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/39671be178e6b827573b77c35c132cac40817c06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a &gt; \\sqrt{3} b . \\hspace{1cm} (7)\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0e216c0f62cb49d418a146a1137951639de6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\lambda b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging this into (6), we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e804b266c1f609da7b6fa3de05aca58e2ed27ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left| \\left( \\left( \\lambda - 2 \\right)^2 - 3 \\right)  \\right| &lt; \\frac{1}{b} \\frac{\\lambda^2 + 1}{\\lambda + 1} .  \\hspace{1cm} (8) \\end{align*}\" width=\"289\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/6/a26e63f0950bbc81b8fdd8320f068f33ac080153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p= a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" /> is a prime, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime.\n</p><p>Therefore, we can use (7), (8), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89bc8dfaed97c079772d7528840446ea92f71838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 &lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime to solve the problem.\n</p><p>To facilitate efficient search, we apply the following criteria:\n</p><p>To satisfy (7) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/336e387b346b606608626da803783d1a0442d73a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e1376fde632a29b6106f36b88103b1b48e9c341e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq b \\leq 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />.\nIn the outer layer, we search for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in a decreasing order.\nIn the inner layer, for each given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, we search for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\nGiven <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, we search for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in the range <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f39fb796a40076c1d5c0ff3735e0b64e29620f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3} b &lt; a &lt; \\sqrt{1000 - b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />.\nWe can prove that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811645be7710ca8371ebee9ed6c30bec49ca5ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />, there is no feasible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\nThe proof is as follows.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811645be7710ca8371ebee9ed6c30bec49ca5ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />, to satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/336e387b346b606608626da803783d1a0442d73a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/1815d4244b0fde0809fa476a0acd5611ab135fbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />.\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407fb9acbb2f817213f52923c9a93faa76b91442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3} &lt; \\lambda \\leq \\frac{30}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"107\" height=\"38\" />.\nThus, the R.H.S. of (8) has the following upper bound\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e002d5883fe00112f89c2e36e6d0a797c6d9382.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{1}{b} \\frac{\\lambda^2 + 1}{\\lambda + 1} &amp; &lt; \\frac{1}{b} \\frac{\\lambda^2 + \\lambda}{\\lambda + 1} \\\\ &amp; = \\frac{\\lambda}{b} \\\\ &amp; \\leq \\frac{\\frac{30}{9}}{9} \\\\ &amp; &lt; \\frac{10}{27} . \\end{align*}\" width=\"155\" height=\"175\" />\n</p><p>Hence, to satisfy (8), a necessary condition is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/a/3da0a1caedc42511870115e733eb62186816abc6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left| \\left( \\left( \\lambda - 2 \\right)^2 - 3 \\right)  \\right| &lt; \\frac{10}{27} . \\end{align*}\" width=\"175\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>However, this cannot be satisfied for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407fb9acbb2f817213f52923c9a93faa76b91442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3} &lt; \\lambda \\leq \\frac{30}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"107\" height=\"38\" />.\nTherefore, there is no feasible solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811645be7710ca8371ebee9ed6c30bec49ca5ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />.\nTherefore, we only need to consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db4b4fb6275ec7d9abd8cef9d4f963e46505043b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\leq 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>We eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> that is not relatively prime to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We use the following criteria to quickly eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> that make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d3200f508f2bf0ee872dcc13ec904170623dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> a composite number.\n</p>\n<ul><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c764af21f8887993b1b4d90e3212af1d151ad06d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv 1 \\pmod{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />, we eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eaed2c60477aaa2d9f1474724c1e2ae2a3d8c6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\equiv 1 \\pmod{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/b/81b0d5742329d8dd92c8fc20d07a8e76137e45ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv \\pm 1 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> (resp. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/490819e310eb723a5b3b584eb849ed1c61ad31ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\equiv \\pm 2 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" />), we eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9279380e1941ef9e623267042b1b9ac730f968a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\equiv \\pm 2 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" /> (resp. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df1a4c8d9d18a3a24e1e0cf06bb6b21c56b2ea56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\equiv \\pm 1 \\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />).</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n\\item For the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/156c1081b4b23a27f715517e5cace3ac3aae35a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( b, a \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, check whether (8) and the condition that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d3200f508f2bf0ee872dcc13ec904170623dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> is prime are both satisfied.\n</p><p>The first feasible solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7b66f4b4d7050101aa1694f4e0176ec0ee5b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />.\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/487a7f7500045696078ff65f32e82b3611d74f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = 349$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>\\item For the remaining search, given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, we only search for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fe954188b5347c69db61b244a6450987df43a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq \\sqrt{349 - b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Following the above search criteria, we find the final answer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7b66f4b4d7050101aa1694f4e0176ec0ee5b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />.\nThus, the largest prime <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89dd0f625aec3ca518fa4de7f0e3ecdfd78509f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = a^2 + b^2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(349) }}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"175\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6201cdb875ab4296812eb4afb2ab76b7f7d9de7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = a + b i (a,b\\in I)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b4dd8a57390ec0a0d57de0af6be1704fd779c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = prime &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/cce8d1c5534c3e5d983aeadf42229a1a3ccc6d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>According to the question, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460b1f1e58b3558ada14b8d951c367c13c7c139c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"59\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343d4f135fc5d57e5ea4356c56649211b1c1f5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7658a1a5a01b68c39bd50391de585b8b581bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z^3|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"21\" /> construct the side-lengths of a non-degenerate triangle.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e667b03be0da999efd18e1250b48dec1bc186b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^3 = (a+bi)^3 = a^3+3a^2bi-3ab^2-b^3i = (a^3 - 3ab^2) + (3a^2b-b^3)i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"540\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb46c05e46f0959c4a274e804e65ee630e7500c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) = a^3 - 3ab^2 &gt; 0 =&gt; a(a^2 - 3b^2) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"349\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:P15.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/49/P15.png/200px-P15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/49/P15.png/300px-P15.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/49/P15.png/400px-P15.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f3d72029b36ff7aa2221ffef0972ab866d297c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) = a^3 - 3ab^2 &gt; 0 =&gt; a(a^2 - 3b^2) &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"349\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:P15_2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/5a/P15_2.png/200px-P15_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"189\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/5a/P15_2.png/300px-P15_2.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/5/5a/P15_2.png/400px-P15_2.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>This means that the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> should be limited in coincident areas these two graphs. \n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:P15_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/f5/P15_1.png/350px-P15_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"320\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/f5/P15_1.png/525px-P15_1.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/f5/P15_1.png/700px-P15_1.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Also\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660d46fa1c9dc6fac2d31bc8627efd23dc9f89f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) + {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right) &gt; |z^3| &gt; |z||z^2|&gt;|z^2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"312\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c80eb293a4a8c4ee4539be6cda778ae4552fbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|{\\rm Re} \\left( z^3 \\right) - {\\rm Im} \\left( z^3 \\right)| &lt; |z|^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"203\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1474efed1e31de6e5154ff110db709dec6ef6303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a^3-3ab^2-(3a^2b-b^3)| &lt; a^2+b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"272\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/c/8bc028f1dd812162582e350c8050189a6926b948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=|a^3-3ab^2+b^3-3a^2b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/0/d704a9821aedd4858c1ec44683e586256bef0636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=|a^3+b^3-3ab(a+b)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a7631f85e541708e30fec04025094c742c5f454.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=|a+b||a^2-4ab+b^2|&lt;a^2+b^2 (*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"286\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/2157aa2de109b2592760a34b8ac183cef31c2161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;0,b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39dad22e418dea31b5f6ce680e75ac2b7b2ff5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a^2-4ab+b^2|&gt;|a^2+b^2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"21\" />, making statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d02e715e7f7195675151570530c5b62ba7b2744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> false.\nCombining with the former graph depicting possible ranges of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />, by loss of generality, we assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f040b184e0e6eaa9464f09c389a6f60fcf1f27c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> and exists in the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73393067e6d6e401a5354accc7a730c7a2977aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> of the circle.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/0/920cf29e2266f3227c3319a0dc349bc7d54a2d41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} = \\lambda &gt; \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b2e2032be295ffb629b4ad2044e8b3a7e9c579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*) |b^3(1+\\lambda)\\cdot({\\lambda}^{2}-4\\lambda+1)| &lt; b^2(1+{\\lambda}^{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"328\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb475fa8540998bd0fcbe1ec5d6e2b15167ac06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;|\\frac{1+{\\lambda}^2}{1+\\lambda}|\\cdot|\\frac{1}{{\\lambda}^{2}-4\\lambda+1}|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"216\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>To clearly visualize, we graph out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee64ab9d02d0ece26e48f82f2e0e7463716f1d18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\frac{1+{\\lambda}^2}{1+\\lambda}|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"65\" height=\"42\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffb307ff9c43ee7b0b94d6183a3f5129051a0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|{\\lambda}^{2}-4\\lambda+1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"21\" /> separately.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:P15_full.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/ed/P15_full.png/700px-P15_full.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"427\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/e/ed/P15_full.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4588fd900d02afcbd260bc07f54cce49a7dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> is around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16d2c7ef186745cbfcaa694d1ea7749a2277a395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, b reaches its maximum upper bound. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93b84a515917dc66de50720ffe6452034b88498f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2(1+{\\lambda}^{2}) &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07ae1b1de680c420d33c5db2c6f05e0a864e43e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2&lt;66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5b1bef6ba0af052a0935c71505781381e08774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\le 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Testing values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in decreasing order, starting from 8, we test out each corresponding value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8da8227edb2a092e9f05478046a1d862c4471769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\cdot\\lambda$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />)by trying the two whole numbers closest to the real value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>We finally get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/0/ad0315a76f0154cf7519f96abd183891d3a8a290.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5, a=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1ad74652ed6351a893d2a5e8fb3225982589131.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 5^2+18^2 = \\boxed{349}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"162\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~cassphe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/V0KFMIXmp08\">https://youtu.be/V0KFMIXmp08</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tELK8fy36bs\">https://youtu.be/tELK8fy36bs</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animated_Video_Solution\">Animated Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Animated Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1Y8ql7eHt34\">https://youtu.be/1Y8ql7eHt34</a>\n</p><p>~Star League (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://starleague.us\">https://starleague.us</a>)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I\" title=\"2023 AIME I\">2023 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2023 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2023\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2023 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_